{"resource":{"id":"react-project-case-study","title":"React.js \u2014 Project Case Study","category":"Web Development","difficulty":"Intermediate","readingTime":"24 min","pages":47,"lastUpdated":"May 2026","tags":["Web Development","React","Hooks"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"How a React engineering team designed, built, optimized, tested, deployed, and maintained a scalable frontend application."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"intro","label":"Introduction"},{"id":"bg","label":"Company Background"},{"id":"biz","label":"Business Requirements"},{"id":"ui","label":"UI Architecture"},{"id":"comp","label":"Component Design"},{"id":"routing","label":"Routing"},{"id":"api","label":"API Integration"},{"id":"state","label":"State Management"},{"id":"perf","label":"Performance Optimization"},{"id":"deploy","label":"Deployment"},{"id":"code","label":"Rollout Config"},{"id":"table","label":"Metrics Before/After"},{"id":"lessons","label":"Lessons Learned"},{"id":"best","label":"Best Practices"},{"id":"mistakes","label":"Common Mistakes"},{"id":"tips","label":"Tips & Tricks"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary & Key Takeaways"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQs"},{"id":"refs","label":"Further Reading & References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"React.js \u2014 Complete Tutorial","tag":"Web Development","time":"45 min"},{"title":"React.js \u2014 Cheat Sheet","tag":"Web Development","time":"5 min"},{"title":"React.js \u2014 Interview Questions","tag":"Web Development","time":"34 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Understand real production trade-offs. See architecture decisions justified. Learn what breaks at scale and how to fix it.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"intro\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Introduction</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>This case study follows an 8-engineer team building a customer-facing SaaS dashboard in React over 14 months \u2014 from prototype to 500K MAU.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"bg\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Company Background</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Series-B SaaS in the analytics space. Existing Angular app on maintenance mode. React rewrite chosen for hiring pool, ecosystem, and DX.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633356122544-f134324a6cee?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Overview diagram for company background.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"biz\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Business Requirements</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Sub-2s Time to Interactive. 99.9% uptime. WCAG AA. SOC 2 compliance. Support 40+ enterprise tenants with custom theming.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"ui\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">UI Architecture</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Vite + React 18 + TypeScript. Tailwind + Radix primitives. Design tokens per tenant. Storybook as the source of truth.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"comp\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Component Design</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Atomic design taxonomy. Headless + skinned. Every component exports a Zod schema for its props. 240 components in Storybook.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"routing\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Routing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>React Router v6 nested routes. Code-split per route. Preload on hover. Route-level error boundaries and suspense fallbacks.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"api\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">API Integration</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>REST + React Query. Optimistic updates on mutations. WebSocket for live metrics. Retry with exponential backoff.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"state\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">State Management</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Server state \u2192 React Query. Client state \u2192 Zustand. URL state \u2192 React Router search params. Zero Redux.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Reference visual for state management.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"perf\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Performance Optimization</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Bundle from 640KB \u2192 180KB via code-splitting + tree-shaking. LCP 3.8s \u2192 1.4s. INP 340ms \u2192 80ms via useDeferredValue and virtualization.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"deploy\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Cloudflare Pages + Workers. Preview per PR. Canary rollouts to 5% \u2192 25% \u2192 100%. Sentry + Datadog RUM.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"code\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Rollout Config</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>import { useState, useEffect } from &quot;react&quot;;\n\nexport function useDebounced&lt;T&gt;(value: T, ms = 300) {\n  const [v, setV] = useState(value);\n  useEffect(() =&gt; {\n    const id = setTimeout(() =&gt; setV(value), ms);\n    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(id);\n  }, [value, ms]);\n  return v;\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"table\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Metrics Before/After</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Concept</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">When to use</th><th class=\"border p-2 text-left\">Trade-off</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useState</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Local UI state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Not for shared state</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">useReducer</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Complex transitions</td><td class=\"border p-2\">More boilerplate</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">Context</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Cross-cutting concerns</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Re-renders consumers</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"border p-2\">React Query</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Server state</td><td class=\"border p-2\">Extra dep</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"lessons\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Lessons Learned</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Invest in Storybook early. Design tokens save months at year 2. Type the API boundary. Ship dark mode from day one.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"best\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Best Practices</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Weekly perf budgets. Feature flags for every new route. Rotate authors of the RFC process.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"mistakes\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Common Mistakes</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Delayed a11y audits. Under-invested in tests early. Chose Redux, migrated to Zustand at month 9.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"tips\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Tips &amp; Tricks</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Ship a design system before a second feature team joins. Automate visual regression.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Scale isn't a code problem, it's a coordination problem. Tools that reduce coordination win.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>How do I get started?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Read the sections in order, then apply immediately to a project.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this current for React 19?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes \u2014 content reflects React 19 and the Compiler.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Where can I ask questions?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Open an issue in the EduNova AI community or ask the in-app AI tutor.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"refs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Further Reading &amp; References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Anonymized composite of real projects; numbers approximated.</p>\n      </div></section>"}